<title>USA: Taiwan seeks 54,000 tonnes of U.S. corn - trade.</title>
<headline>Taiwan seeks 54,000 tonnes of U.S. corn - trade.</headline>
<dateline>CHICAGO 1997-07-02</dateline>
<text>
<p>Taiwan's Members Feed Industry Group was scheduled to tender late Wednesday for 54,000 tonnes of No. 2 U.S. corn, U.S. exporters said.</p>
<p>It seeks the corn for August 6-20 shipment from U.S. Gulf or August 21 to September 5 from the Pacific Northwest.</p>
<p>((Chicago newsdesk 312-408-8720))</p>
</text>
